        <div class="for"><h3>Then the secret</h3><p>Hidden among the 200 puzzles in the book are shaded keys, and they open a vault on this site. <a href="/escape-room-sudoku-book">Here is how the escape-room layer works</a>.</p></div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="sec-h" id="glossary">Sudoku words, in plain English</h2>
